@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080

### Health check
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### DB health check
GET {{baseUrl}}/health/db

### List posts
GET {{baseUrl}}/posts?page=1&size=10

### Create post
POST {{baseUrl}}/posts
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": 1,
  "title": "Hello",
  "content": "First post"
}

### List comments by post
GET {{baseUrl}}/comments?postId=1

### Create comment
POST {{baseUrl}}/comments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "postId": 1,
  "userId": 1,
  "content": "Nice post"
}